mapping "V6444.1" source="V6444" target="242107006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6444 is a Swedish 7th-character ICD-10 extension of V64.4 (Occupant of heavy transport
        vehicle injured in collision with heavy transport vehicle or bus, person injured while boarding
        or alighting). The 7th character SNOMED CT 242107006 encodes the activity at time of injury:
        vitalaktivitet såsom vila, sömn, måltid och personlig hygien (vital activity). This contextual
        axis (what the injured person was doing) has no clinical SNOMED CT equivalent. Target SNOMED CT
        4053428 = is the parent V64.x's verified Athena standard concept; it fully captures the injury
        event (heavy-transport collision, v64.4) but drops the activity qualifier. broader: target
        subsumes the source's injury event without the contextual axis. Moderate : parent crosswalk
        verified in the ICD10/SNOMED CT mirror, but the Swedish extension is not independently re-verified.
        """
}
